Overview of Workflow :

When a new email receives the new-ticket label, this Zap is triggered. AI analyzes the email, determines the issue category, sentiment, and urgency, and generates a short summary. The ticket is then routed to the appropriate support team via Slack, the ticket details are logged in Google Sheets, and a confirmation email is sent to the customer.
